WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.528
So why revisit this now?

00:00:01.608 --> 00:00:08.967
Because subtraction pays off: a mixture that can
cancel mass captures complex shapes with far fewer components.

00:00:09.047 --> 00:00:12.854
The problem is guaranteeing the result stays non-negative.

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:16.942
Energy-based models enforce non-negativity by
exponentiation,

00:00:17.022 --> 00:00:19.489
but then lose tractable normalization.

00:00:19.569 --> 00:00:22.102
Meanwhile several separate communities,

00:00:22.182 --> 00:00:26.257
from signal processing to kernel methods to quantum
mechanics,

00:00:26.337 --> 00:00:31.819
each rediscovered a squaring trick to enforce
non-negativity, but without a common,

00:00:31.899 --> 00:00:34.500
tractable framework tying them together.
